ight: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260523/202605232334534882_720.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260523/202605232334534882_720.jpg"> </div><p>【拜仁加冕国内赛事三冠王】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-24/6a11bf06b5dbanative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">🏆三冠凯歌！拜仁夺德国杯冠军，成就德甲+德国杯+德超杯三冠王</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.56" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260524/6a11e8539d168.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260524/6a11e8539d168.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260524/6a11e8539d168.jpg"> </div><p>德国杯决赛，拜仁成功战胜斯图加特，斩获德国杯冠军，圆满收官本赛季国内赛场征程，一举拿下本赛季德国超级杯、德甲联赛、德国杯三项国内赛事冠军。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-24/match1972388date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">时隔6年夺德国杯冠军！拜仁3-0斯图加特加冕国内三冠王 凯恩戴帽</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.72" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260524/zhanbao_image_1972388_1779566345_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.72" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.72" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260524/zhanbao_image_1972388_1779566345_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260524/zhanbao_image_1972388_1779566345_gray.jpeg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">拜仁3-0完胜斯图加特，凯恩斩获帽子戏法！</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-24/6a1203234a57fnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">一个一个来！32岁凯恩加盟拜仁3年获得四个冠军，加盟前生涯0冠军</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260523/6a11a08537f16.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260523/6a11a08537f16.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260523/6a11a08537f16.jpg"> </div><p>拿下德国杯后，<span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">这是32岁的凯恩加盟拜仁以来获得的第四个冠军荣誉。</span></p><p>【比赛战报】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-24/match1730711date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">赢球收官！皇马4-2毕巴 卡瓦哈尔告别战助攻 姆巴佩贝林厄姆破门</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.69" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260524/zhanbao_image_1730711_1779569630_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.69" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.69" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260524/zhanbao_image_1730711_1779569630_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260524/zhanbao_image_1730711_1779569630_gray.jpeg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">皇马4-2击败毕尔巴鄂竞技，本赛季西甲结束，皇马最终排名积分榜第二。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-24/match1730712date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">联赛94分收官！巴萨1-3遭瓦伦逆转 莱万告别战破门费兰献助攻</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.72" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260524/zhanbao_image_1730712_1779570015_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.72" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.72" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260524/zhanbao_image_1730712_1779570015_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260524/zhanbao_image_1730712_1779570015_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>巴萨1-3瓦伦西亚，赛季94分收官，莱万在巴萨生涯告别战打入一球。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-24/match1711072date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">两连平收官！国米3-3博洛尼亚 迪马尔科任意球破门泽林斯基乌龙</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.72" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260524/zhanbao_image_1711072_1779558580_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.72" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.72" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260524/zhanbao_image_1711072_1779558580_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260524/zhanbao_image_1711072_1779558580_gray.jpeg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">国米3-3博洛尼亚，蓝黑军团以两连平积87分收官本赛季。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-24/match1975352date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">队史第四座欧冠！巴萨女足4-0里昂女足 帕乔尔萨尔玛均两射一传</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-24/6a11ef66b84c5native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">一路横扫！巴萨女足本赛季参加四项赛事全问鼎 欧冠全程不败夺冠</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260524/202605240202219817.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260524/202605240202219817.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260524/202605240202219817.jpg"> </div><p>巴塞罗那女足4-0战胜里昂女足，夺得女足欧冠奖杯。这是巴萨女足队史第四个女足欧冠冠军，她们近6个赛季女足欧冠均打进决赛，其中4次夺冠。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-24/match1982719date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">绝杀！赫尔城1-0米德尔斯堡升入英超 麦克伯尼补时制胜</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-24/6a11ca589fdecnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">老虎城久违了！赫尔城时隔9年重回英超，英冠第6连续2轮下克上！</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260524/zhanbao_image_1982719_1779554733_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260524/zhanbao_image_1982719_1779554733_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260524/zhanbao_image_1982719_1779554733_gray.jpeg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">赫尔城1-0米德尔斯堡，升入下赛季英超联赛，老虎城</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">时隔9年重回英超！</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-24/6a11c595da13bnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">西甲大结局：巴萨提前夺冠 姆巴佩金靴 贝蒂斯进欧冠 马略卡降级</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.56" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260504/69f771dc6366d.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260504/69f771dc6366d.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260504/69f771dc6366d.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">本赛季西甲联赛绝大部分比赛都已结束，联赛大结局尘埃落定。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-24/6a121a10269banative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">西甲本赛季三支降级队：马略卡、赫罗纳、皇家奥维耶多</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.36" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260524/202605240524123492.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.36" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.36" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260524/202605240524123492_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260524/202605240524123492_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">本赛季西甲末轮绝大多数比赛均已结束，下赛季将降级至西乙联赛的三支队伍正式出炉。</span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">【其他新闻】</span></p><p><a href="http